 <!-- CARROT:MANUAL:BEGIN ApplyModelSpeed -->
 <!-- CARROT:REVIEW reviewed-for="" -->
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN BEHAVIOR -->
+### Behavior
+
+This test branch caps automatic road/model changes at the selected cruise speed. A curve can lower speed and release its limit without raising the selection. Explicit speed commands remain available. AutoSpeedUptoRoadSpeedLimit=0 also disables AutoRoadSpeedAdjust; stored nonzero values cannot autonomously raise cruise speed.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END BEHAVIOR -->
 <!-- CARROT:MANUAL:END ApplyModelSpeed -->
 
